Independent baseline draws, patient innovations, processes, item-specific errors, quality/function errors, diary/wearable errors, delivery/rescue, report/wearable delay and missingness uniforms are mutually independent conditional on specified parents. Exceptions: three-dimensional L innovations share the stated covariance; N1 severity residuals follow stationary AR rho with innovation SD .4 and **replace** eta rather than double it; ISI items share 14-night recall plus recall error; correlated-item stress adds a Gaussian equicorrelation copula, rho .4, while preserving each logistic marginal. Draw common/item normals independently, map `sqrt(rho)*g0+sqrt(1-rho)*gj` through Normal CDF to a uniform, then inverse ordinal CDF. Heavy-tail sensitivity replaces eta with t(3)*(.4/sqrt(3)); nonlinear sensitivity adds .15*(pain^2-1). Those explicit Layer C extensions require independent code, never the fitted likelihood. No extra unlisted covariance or shared latent common cause is allowed.

